NAME
    smp - Read permitted SMP information.

SYNOPSIS
    smp [status]

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Runs as an isolated userland command and issues Get(command.smp.get). It reports SMP information allowed to the calling process and cannot change SMP lifecycle state.

ALIASES
    (none)

FILES
    /System/Commands/SMP.CMD
    /INU/HELP/SMP.MAN
